id=nfc-dada-pudding
name=NFC ST54L pudding stack (Xiaomi 15 dada)
version=1.2
versionCode=3
author=local-research
description=Runtime bind-mount overlay of Xiaomi 17 (pudding OS3) ST54L NFC HAL/firmware/configs onto Xiaomi 15 (dada). post-fs-data overlay with SELinux label verification; no forced HAL/NfcService restarts (v1.2 fixes the OS4.0.3.0 boot ANR). Remove module + reboot to revert.
